; PiP per-scope objective placement, x,y lateral and z forward to the front lens with w the
; objective radius, all in eyepiece radii so the numbers survive any mesh scale.
; Read by zzz_extra_scope_features when no section carries scope_objective_lens_offset, ahead of
; the engine mesh detection, so an authored optic never rides a lens the detector picked.
; A section-authored offset still wins over this table.

; Sections for weapon packs ship with the mod that adds them, as a DLTX file next to this one:
; mod_pip_objective_offsets_<name>.ltx (the GAMMA Patch carries the GAMMA rows).
